     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, March 18, 2016 at 5:28:11 PM UTC+1, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">On Friday, March 18, 2016 at 7:49:13 AM UTC-4, Craig Wang wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">1. if I add useDynLib(eggCounts, .registration = TRUE), it gives me <br><div><br></div><div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Error in library.dynam(lib, package, package.lib) : \r\n  shared object ‘eggCounts.so’ not found</pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">Is this because I didn&#39;t install eggCounts in the first place? I thought this is to prepare the </span><font face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">RcppModules, without the useDynLib() I have the error</span></font></pre></div></div></blockquote><div><br>You should have a useDynLib(eggCounts, .registration = TRUE). I am not sure why you are getting the above error. If you do<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">R CMD build </span><span style=\"color:#660\">--</span><span style=\"color:#008\">no</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">build</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vignettes eggCounts<br></span></div></code></div><br>and then inspect eggCounts*.tar.gz does it seem to have everything, such as src/ and exec/ directories?<br> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important\"><pre style=\"text-align:left;color:rgb(0,0,0);outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13.8667px\"><font face=\"Ubuntu Mono\" color=\"#000000\">2</font></span><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;color:rgb(34,34,34);font-size:13px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;white-space:normal\">. I also had this error, I am using Linux server at my university</span><br></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;;font-size:10.4pt;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">Warning: file &#39;eggCounts/cleanup&#39; did not have execute permissions: corrected</span> </pre></pre></pre></div></div></blockquote><div><br>I think that is mentioned in the read-and-delete-me file. You can just do<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">chmod </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x cleanup<br>chmod </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x cleanup</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">win<br></span></div></code></div><br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit\">3. In Rstudio if I click Load All, it creates several files in src/ then everything seems to work fine after Build and Reload the package again.</span></pre></pre></div></div></blockquote><div><br>Okay. It is probably close to correct.<br><br>Ben<br><br><br><br> </div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal;font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;line-height:inherit\"><br></span></pre></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">Thanks for any suggestions,</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;white-space:normal\">Craig</span></pre><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;border-width:initial;word-break:break-all;width:588px;padding:6px;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:&#39;Ubuntu Mono&#39;!important;font-size:10.4pt!important;font-style:inherit!important;font-variant:inherit!important;font-weight:inherit!important;line-height:inherit!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></blockquote></div></div>"
    ]
